sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>(data-science-gateway)<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>gRPC ExtProc<br/>Optional TLS
    participant ModelPod as Model-Serving Pod<br/>(podIP:port)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,ModelPod: Inference Request Flow

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPRoute → InferencePool backendRef
    Gateway->>Envoy: Route to InferencePool
    Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ExtProc Callout<br/>(ProcessingRequest)

    Note over EPP: Plugin Pipeline Execution
    Note over EPP: 1. Parse request (openai-parser)
    Note over EPP: 2. Extract data-layer signals
    Note over EPP: 3. Saturation detection (utilization-detector)
    Note over EPP: 4. Flow control (priority bands + fairness)
    Note over EPP: 5. Score/filter endpoints (scheduling profile)
    Note over EPP: 6. Select backend endpoint

    EPP-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(selected podIP:port)
    Envoy->>ModelPod: Forward inference request<br/>to selected endpoint
    ModelPod-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: Inference result

    Note over EPP,ModelPod: Metrics Collection (Background)

    loop Periodic metrics scrape
        EPP->>ModelPod: HTTP GET /metrics<br/>Scrape model-serving metrics
        ModelPod-->>EPP: Prometheus metrics<br/>(utilization, queue depth, etc.)
    end

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation (Background)

    loop Controller watches
        K8sAPI-->>EPP: Watch events:<br/>InferencePool, InferenceObjective,<br/>InferenceModelRewrite, Pod, ConfigMap
        Note over EPP: Update in-memory datastore<br/>with cluster state
    end

    Note over EPP: InferenceModelRewrite<br/>applies model name rewriting<br/>with weighted traffic distribution

    Note over EPP: InferenceObjective<br/>assigns priority levels<br/>for flow control within a pool
